# Parabolic chief factors of the actual binary Steinberg module

H.6.3(3) is proved by an explicit invariant chief series for the point
parabolic, with three noncentral simple sections and two central sections.
Automorphism transport gives the marked line parabolic and every conjugate.
The fixed space of every subgroup of order three has dimension two.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004, printed
pp.387–388; the order-three consequence is also used in B.4.11, printed p.96.
-/
